---
title: Step 1 — User registration + validation check
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant V as validateRegister
    participant C as controllers/auth
    participant UM as User model
    participant DB as MongoDB

    U->>V: POST /auth/register {name, tel, email, password}
    alt missing tel, bad email or password under 8 chars
        V-->>U: 400 Bad Request
    end
    V->>C: register()
    C->>UM: create({name, tel, email, password, role: user})
    UM->>UM: hash password with bcrypt
    UM->>DB: insert user
    alt email already registered
        DB-->>C: duplicate key
        C-->>U: 400 Email already registered
    end
    C-->>U: 201 {user} + HttpOnly cookies (access + refresh token)
